ode SHANNON to get $150 instantly in Lineups if you win your first $5 Lineup! https://prizepicks.onelink.me/LME0/NIGHTCAP\n\nIf you’re ever injured, you can check out Morgan & Morgan.  Their fee is free unless they win. For more information go to http://forthepeople.com/NIGHTCAP or dial #LAW (#529) from your cell phone. This is a paid advertisement. \n\nFollow Nightcap on all platforms: \nTwitter: https://twitter.com/NightcapShow_\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/nightcapshow_/\nTikTok: https://www.tiktok.com/@nightcapshow_\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=61551822396133\n\nABOUT NIGHTCAP:\nNo more waiting until morning. Nightcap is the new nighttime sports talk destination with legends Shannon Sharpe, Chad “Ochocinco” Johnson and \"Iso\" Joe Johnson. Hang out with Unc and Ocho as they give their unfiltered takes on the latest headlines from the NFL, NBA, and college football, and give their instant reactions to the biggest games moments after they end.\n\n#Nightcap #ShannonSharpe #ochocinco #joejohnson #unc #ocho #iso"}]},"displayStyle":"MUSIC_MULTI_ROW_LIST_ITEM_DISPLAY_STYLE_EXPANDED"}},{"musicMultiRowListItemRenderer":{"thumbnail":{"musicThumbnailRenderer":{"thumbnail":{"thumbnails":[{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/0yR_s6U6CDI/hqdefault.jpg?sqp=-oaymwEWCJADEOEBIAQqCggAEOADGC0guwJIWg&rs=AMzJL3l1OK0Z6ldnPtP7I5GXw8Esf0JbcA","width":400,"height":225},{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/0yR_s6U6CDI/hq720.jpg?sqp=-oaymwEKCKAGEMIDIABIWg&rs=AMzJL3mt6jQG-FQ0rPxQoxmgkY0RDpf1Fw","width":800,"height":450},{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/0yR_s6U6CDI/hq720.jpg?sqp=-oaymwEKCNUGEN8DIABIWg&rs=AMzJL3nFisXqUGqcKTG36Qr242f14Ox1XQ","width":853,"height":479}]},"thumbnailCrop":"MUSIC_THUMBNAIL_CROP_UNSPECIFIED","thumbnailScale":"MUSIC_THUMBNAIL_SCALE_ASPECT_FIT"}},"overlay":{"musicItemThumbnailOverlayRenderer":{"content":{"musicPlayButtonRenderer":{"playNavigationEndpoint":{"watchEndpoint":{"videoId":"0yR_s6U6CDI","params":"8gEDmAEI","watchEndpointMusicSupportedConfigs